# The fixture directories are checked by byte and by line, so they are pinned to
# LF: on Windows git converts to CRLF on checkout, and a fixture whose bytes
# differ between the tree the criteria were demonstrated on and the tree a
# reviewer checks out is a fixture that proves something about neither.
#
# Only *.txt is pinned here. The root .gitattributes already pins *.html, *.css
# and *.tsv for the whole tree and marks the image types binary, so restating
# any of those here would be a second copy of a setting whose only possible
# effect is to disagree with the first.
*.txt text eol=lf
